      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# OmniCam — Still Image Scene Reconstruction to Director\n\nConvert a single still image into an editable 3D proxy scene, block camera moves in Director, and compile conditioning for video models.\n\n### How to use\n1. Feed a still image into `MajoorOmniCamExtractor`.\n2. In the Extractor panel, click **Scene Reconstruct** mode, choose a quality preset, and click **▶ RECONSTRUCT**.\n3. Click **OPEN IN DIRECTOR** to adopt the reconstructed environment mesh and fitted ground plane.\n4. Animate your camera in Director, record a playblast, and queue to compile through Monitor."
      ]
    }
